EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Don't get bent out of shape. Just
listen! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}You might actually like what
you hear!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Remember that thing you asked
about?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Well, I got my hands on it!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}¡Que no se te crucen los cables!
Tú escúchame, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}¡y seguro que
al final me das las gracias!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¿Recuerdas eso que tanto
querías?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Pues resulta que...
¡te lo he conseguido!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}In realtà non ti devi preoccupare.
Senti qua! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Sono convinta che ti
piacerà quello che sto per dirti!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ti ricordi di quella cosa che mi
avevi chiesto?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Beh, si dà il caso
che sia riuscita a trovarla!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Tief durchatmen, Junge. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Ich werde
dich schon nich' mit meinen grandi-
osen Kochkünsten malträtieren!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Kannste dich noch dunkel dran
erinnern, dass du mich um was
gebeten hast?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Ich hab's organisiert!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Gerilme. Dinle yeter! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Duyacağın şey
hoşuna bile gidebilir!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Hani sorduğun şey vardı ya?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
İşte onu buldum!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0016:}}Aa, doğru!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Sana sormam gereken bir şey vardı!
/ {{TAG:0003:0009:}}Kasabada yakında yeni bir {{TAG:0005:000F:0000}}
özel mağazası açılacakmış diye duydum.
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Doğru mu?{{TAG:0003:0015:}} Çünkü doğruysa açılış günü
kapısında kamp kuracağım!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Hazırlanmam lazım!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}¡Vaya susto me llevé cuando supe
que querías verme! Pero al final no
fue para tanto. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¡Hasta me alegro!{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Ah, y gracias a ti, {{TAG:0005:0008:}},{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
¡por ir a buscarme! ¡Eres
muy enrollad{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}!
{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bueno, yo ahora me marcho que
quería ver una película.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Hasta lueguito, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
